```rust
impl Solution {
    pub fn reverse_string(s: &mut Vec<char>) {
        fn reverse(s: &mut Vec<char>, l: usize, r: usize) {
            if l < r {
                reverse(s, l + 1, r - 1);
                s.swap(l, r);
            }
        }
        if !s.is_empty() {
            reverse(s, 0, s.len() - 1);
        }
    }
}
```

::tabs-end

### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity: $O(n)$
- Space complexity: $O(n)$ for recursion stack.

